## Table anatomy

Below is an **illustrative** decile table of the same *shape* as published
momentum results (synthetic numbers, for practicing how to read tables — the
real one is in the paper):

| Decile (by past 12–2m return) | Avg monthly return (%) | t-stat |
|---|---|---|
| 1 (losers) | −0.15 | −0.5 |
| 2 | 0.05 | 0.2 |
| 3 | 0.22 | 0.8 |
| 4 | 0.31 | 1.1 |
| 5 | 0.44 | 1.6 |
| 6 | 0.55 | 2.0 |
| 7 | 0.68 | 2.5 |
| 8 | 0.83 | 3.0 |
| 9 | 1.02 | 3.6 |
| 10 (winners) | 1.25 | 4.2 |
| **W − L spread** | **1.40** | **4.6** |

